# TBCGuide - Undead start: Deathknell and Tirisfal Glades (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_Undead_Tirisfal
@name Deathknell & Tirisfal Glades
@faction Horde
@races Scourge
@levels 1-11
@zone Tirisfal Glades
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Undead starting route. Deathknell to about 5, then Brill, the Agamand Mills, the Scarlet Crusade camps and the Undercity. Ends at about 11, heading to Silverpine Forest.
@next H_Silverpine

accept Rude Awakening | Undertaker Mordo.
turnin Rude Awakening | Shadow Priest Sarvis.
accept The Mindless Ones
complete The Mindless Ones | Mindless Zombies and Wretched Zombies.
turnin The Mindless Ones
accept Rattling the Rattlecages | Offered once The Mindless Ones is turned in.
accept The Damned
complete Rattling the Rattlecages | Rattlecage Skeletons.
complete The Damned | Young Night Webs and Scrawny Duskbats.
turnin Rattling the Rattlecages
turnin The Damned
accept Scavenging Deathknell | Deathguard Saltain.
accept Marla's Last Wish | Novice Elreth.
accept Night Web's Hollow | Executor Arren.
complete Scavenging Deathknell | Supplies in the houses of Deathknell.
complete Night Web's Hollow | Night Web Spiders in the hollow.
turnin Scavenging Deathknell
turnin Night Web's Hollow
accept The Scarlet Crusade | Offered once Night Web's Hollow is turned in.
complete The Scarlet Crusade | Scarlet Converts and Initiates east.
complete Marla's Last Wish | Samuel Fipps; bury Marla's remains in the graveyard.
turnin The Scarlet Crusade
accept The Red Messenger
turnin Marla's Last Wish
complete The Red Messenger | Meven Korgal, at the Scarlet camp.
turnin The Red Messenger
accept Vital Intelligence
train | Trainers in Deathknell's church.
turnin Vital Intelligence | Executor Zygand, Brill.
accept 427 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
accept A Putrid Task | Deathguard Dillinger.
accept Graverobbers | Magistrate Sevren.
accept 365 Fields of Grief | Deathguard Simmer.
accept Wanted: Maggot Eye
accept Gordo's Task | Gordo, on the road.
bind Brill
turnin 365 Fields of Grief | Apothecary Johaan.
accept 407 Fields of Grief
accept 367 A New Plague
complete 407 Fields of Grief | Pumpkins in the Solliden Farmstead fields.
complete 367 A New Plague
complete A Putrid Task | Rotting Dead and Ravaged Corpses.
complete Graverobbers
complete 427 At War With The Scarlet Crusade | Scarlet Warriors at Solliden Farmstead.
turnin 407 Fields of Grief
turnin 367 A New Plague
accept 368 A New Plague
turnin A Putrid Task
accept The Mills Overrun
turnin Graverobbers
accept Forsaken Duties
turnin 427 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
accept 370 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
complete Gordo's Task | Gloom Weed around Brill.
turnin Gordo's Task
complete Wanted: Maggot Eye | Maggot Eye at the Garren's Haunt farm.
turnin Wanted: Maggot Eye
complete The Mills Overrun | Agamand Mills, north.
complete 368 A New Plague | Vile Fin murlocs on the coast.
turnin Forsaken Duties | Deathguard Linnea, the bridge north.
accept Return to the Magistrate
turnin Return to the Magistrate
accept The Chill of Death | Gretchen Dedmar.
turnin The Mills Overrun
turnin 368 A New Plague
accept 369 A New Plague
complete 370 At War With The Scarlet Crusade | Captain Perrine, Scarlet Crusade camp.
complete 369 A New Plague | Greater Duskbats.
turnin 370 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
accept 371 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
turnin 369 A New Plague
complete The Chill of Death | Duskbats and Vile Fin murlocs.
turnin The Chill of Death
accept Deaths in the Family | Coleman Farthing, Brill inn.
accept The Haunted Mills
complete Deaths in the Family | Agamand relatives in the mills crypt.
complete The Haunted Mills | Devlin Agamand in the mills.
turnin Deaths in the Family
turnin The Haunted Mills
complete 371 At War With The Scarlet Crusade | Scarlet Zealots at the Scarlet Watch Post.
turnin 371 At War With The Scarlet Crusade
